        "created_at": "2014-03-11T03:07:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like it, only I'd move Con and Omnitron-X into different timelines and have the merger to form Con be a desperate gamble by the heroes, in a future where Omnitron has gotten powerful enough that they can't stop it Golem Unity merges with Omnitron to stop him.</p><p>Perhaps as a trick where Omnitron attempts to absorb Golem Unity.</p>",
