        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/eggroll20xd6/{size}/1993_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-30T19:19:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just a thought, but what if \"Con\" is the \"conciousness\" of all the freedom 5/6 that Unity built as golems and now they exist as one? &nbsp;Maybe after all of the original heroes have fallen, their conciousness exist in their golems...</p>",
