      {
        "id": 95320,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-09T13:58:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The incap of Termi-Bunker is weird to me for a number of reasons. Not the least of which is that it implies Omnitron IV is still in the picture at this late point in the story, and that there doesn't seem to be any incorporation of that technology in the future version V iteration. So maybe there is a story about IV and this picture that isn't depicted or hinted at anywhere in game.&nbsp;</p><p>There will 100% be an Omnitron-X promo that comes out with the next and final expansion (since he doesn't have one yet). I'd wager that the promo will tie into this incap art in some way.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:07.629Z",
