        "created_at": "2015-12-09T14:19:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not fully sure how long after Vengeance we see Omnitron IV as the environment cards don't list comic issues. &nbsp; In the game Choke who becomes Chokepoint was in Vengeance along with OmniBlade (Omnitron III) and both were badly hurt from that event. &nbsp; &nbsp;It's plausible to me that Omnitron IV wasn't fully formed as a robotics factory until during or after Chokepoint appears. &nbsp;</p>",
