        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Isn't V trying to reassemble itself? Couldn't there be parts of Omnitron out there that do have Bunker pieces incorporated into them that V has just not found yet?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's possible, but I thought the implication in the Tactics OmnitronV scenario was that he required all of his previous self to complete the OmniReaper. But you know, comics.</p>",
